==Latin==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*lēnis|t=soft, mild}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro|*leh₁-|t=lazy, slow; soft}}.<ref>{{R:itc:EDL|page=333}}</ref>

Cognate to {{cog|sla-pro|*lěnь|t=laziness}} and to {{cog|lt|lė́nas|t=slow, calm}}.<ref>{{R:Nocentini|hw=lene}}</ref> Compare also {{m|la|lentus}}, of similar sound and meaning but different origin.

====Pronunciation====
